# Ignore everything except src/
*
!.gitignore
!src/

# acsl_lockstep_interfaces is a normal tracked folder (not a submodule like the two packages above), so it has to be
# un-ignored explicitly. It must stay IDENTICAL to the copy in ACSL-flightstack-winged/src/acsl_lockstep_interfaces.
!src/acsl_lockstep_interfaces/
!src/acsl_lockstep_interfaces/**
